{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "1", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ο θάνατος του Διγενή"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "2", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Δημοτικό τραγούδι"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "3", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Αʹ"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "4", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ὅ Διγενῆς ψυχομαχεῖ κ’ ἡ γῆ τόνε τροµάσσει."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "5", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Βροντᾷ κι’ ἀστράφτει ὁ οὐρανὸς καὶ σειέτ’ ὁ ἀπάνω κόσµος,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "6", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κι’ ὁ κάτω κόσμος ἄνοιξε καὶ τρίζουν τὰ θεµέλια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "7", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κ’ ἡ πλάκα τὸν ἀνατριχιᾷ πῶς θὰ τόνε σκεπάσῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "8", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πῶς θὰ σκεπάσῃ τὸν ἀιτὸ τσῇ γῆς τὸν ἀντρειωμένο."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "9", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Σπίτι δὲν τὸν ἐσκέπαζε, σπήλιο δὲν τὸν ἐχώρει,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "10", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὰ ὄρη ἐδιασκέλιζε, βουνοῦ κορφαῖς ἐπήδα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "11", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "χαράκι’ ἀμαδολόγανε καὶ ῥιζιμιὰ ξεκούνειε."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "12", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "’Σ τὸ βίτσιμά πιανε πουλιά, ς τὸ πέταµα γεράκια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "13", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "’ς γλάκιο καὶ ’ς τὸ πήδηµα τὰ λάφια καὶ τἀγρίμια."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "14", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ζηλεύγει ὁ Χάρος μὲ χωσιά, μακρὰ τόνε βιγλίζει,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "15", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κ’ ἐλάθωσέ του τὴν χαρδιὰ καὶ τὴ ψυχή του πῆρε."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "16", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Βʹ"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "17", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Τρίτη ἐγεννήθη ὁ Διγενὴς καὶ Τρίτη θὰ πεθάνῃ."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "18", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Πιάνει καλεῖ τοὺς φίλους του κι’ ὅλους τοὺς ἀντρειωμένους,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "19", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νά ρθῃ ὁ Μηνᾶς κι’ ὁ Μαυραϊλής, νά ρθῃ κι’ ὁ γιὸς τοῦ Δράκου,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "20", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νά ρθῃ κι’ ὁ Τρεμαντάχειλος, ποῦ τρέµει ἡ γῇ κι’ ὁ κόσµος."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "21", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Κ’ ἐπῆγαν καὶ τὸν ηὕρανε ’ς τὸν κάµπο ξαπλωμένο."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "22", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Βογγάει, τρέµουν τὰ βουνά, βογγάει, τρέµουν οἱ κάμποι."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "23", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Σὰν τί νὰ σ’ ηὗρε Διγενή, καὶ θέλεις νὰ πεθάνῃς;"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "24", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Φίλοι, καλῶς ὡρίσατε, φίλοι κι’ ἀγαπημένοι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "25", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "συχάσατε, καθήσατε κ’ ἐγὼ σᾶς ἀφηγειέμαι."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "26", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Τῆς Ἀραβίνας τὰ βουνά, τῆς Σύρας τὰ λαγκάδια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "27", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ποῦ κεῖ συνδυὸ δὲν περπατοῦν, συντρεῖς δὲν κουβεντιάζουν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "28", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "παρὰ πενῆντα κ’ ἑκατό, καὶ πάλε φόβο νἔχουν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "29", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κ’ ἐγὼ µονάχος πέρασα πεζὸς κι’ ἁρματωμένος,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "30", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μὲ τετραπίθαµο σπαθί, μὲ τρεῖς ὀργυιαῖς κοντάρι."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "31", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Βουνὰ καὶ κάμπους ἔδειρα, βουνὰ καὶ καταράχια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "32", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νυχτιαῖς χωρὶς ἀστροφεγγιά, νυχτιαῖς χωρὶς φεγγάρι."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "33", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ τόσα χρόνια ποῦ ζησα δῶ ’ς τὸν ἀπάνου κόσμο"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "34", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κανένα δὲ φοβήθηκα ἀπὸ τοὺς ἀντρειωμένους."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "35", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Τώρά εἰδα ἕναν ξυπόλυτο καὶ λαµπροφορεµένο,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "36", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πὄχει τοῦ ῥίσου τὰ πλουμιά, τῆς ἀστραπῆς τὰ µάτια·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "37", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μὲ κράζει νὰ παλέψωμε σὲ µαρµαρένια ἀλώνια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "38", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κι’ ὅποιος νικῆσῃ ἀπὸ τοὺς δυὸ νὰ παίρνῃ τὴν ψυχή του.»"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "39", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Κ’ ἐπῆγαν κ’ ἐπαλέψανε ’ς τὰ µαρµαρένια ἀλώνια·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "40", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κι’ ὅθε χτυπάει ὁ Διγενής, τὸ αἷμα αὐλάκι κάνει,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "41", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κι’ ὅθε χτυπάει ὁ Χάροντας, τὸ αἷμα τράφο κάνει."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "42", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ο Διγενής ψυχομαχεί"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "43", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ριζίτικα Κρήτης"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "44", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ο Διγενής ψυχομαχεί κι’ η γή τονε τρομάσσει"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "45", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Κι’ η πλάκα τον ανατριχιά πώς θα τονε σκεπάσει"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "46", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πώς θα σκεπάσει τον αετό τση γής τον αντρειωμένο"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "47", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "γιατί από ‘κειά που κείτεται λόγια αντρειωμένα λέει:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "48", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "— Νά χεν η γής πατήματα κιο ουρανός κερκέλια"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "49", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "να πάθιουν τα πατήματα νά ‘πιανα τα κερκέλια"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "50", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "να ανέβαινα στον ουρανό να διπλωθώ να κάτσω"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "51", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "να δώσω σείσμα τ’ουρανού να βγάλει μαύρα νέφη"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_death", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "52", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "να βρέξει χιόνι και νερό!"}
